        "original_id": "e66e5a7a-8d41-56d9-a789-699ab2ee3e3a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ryan Bundy, Ammon Bundy\n- Organizations: U.S. Bureau of Land Management\n- Topics: Grazing fees, public land disputes, court orders\n\nFacts:\n- Ryan Bundy, the son of Ammon Bundy, was ordered to pay more than $1 million in grazing fees.\n- The grazing fees were tied to the use of public lands.\n- The order reflects an ongoing dispute involving Bundy family members and U.S. land management authorities.",
